# =============================================================================
# Genesis Studio - Git Ignore Configuration
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Build Outputs & Generated Artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/bin/
**/obj/
.build/
Dist/
Genesis Application/
TestResults/
Installer/redist/
Installer/art/
Ignore/
Backups/
[Bb]ackup/
[Bb]ackups/
Workspace/

# Compiled Binaries & Release Archives
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib
*.nupkg
*.msi
*.zip

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Project Templates & Starter Assets
# (Excludes heavy demo/template assets, sprites like spr_Luigi, music, and audio)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/Projects/Templates/Assets/
**/Templates/Assets/
**/Templates/*.zip
**/TemplateBundles/
**/LuigisMansion/
**/TwoDShowcase/
**/NatureWalk/

# Specific template media (sprites and audio/music)
*spr_Luigi*
*spr_LUigi*
*spr_luigi*

# Audio and Music files
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.flac
*.aiff
*.m4a
*.wma
*.aac

# User-created Genesis Projects & Saves
*.genesisproj

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
